{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>חושים</b> — Two times in the Masorah: in two formulations, here and the other: ובני דן חושים. And that is what is taught in the chapter מי שמת. And perhaps like חושים of reeds — meaning, many reeds grow from one root and above they separate one from another. And so the meaning: we shall array ourselves like חושים of reeds that cling one to another — thus we shall array ourselves for battle, for so is the way of warriors to draw close one to another so that the enemies not separate them."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:23:33.960561498Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}